<section class="hb-section dark" id="system"><div class="hb-wrap">
<span class="hb-kicker">FROM AD TO APPOINTMENT</span>
<h2>What happens after someone asks about a style?</h2>
<p class="hb-intro">A salon can receive plenty of leads and still have empty appointments. Every inquiry needs a clear next step and an accountable person or workflow.</p>
<div class="hb-journey">
<button class="hb-step active" data-step="0" aria-pressed="true"><small>01 / ATTRACT</small><strong>Relevant local demand</strong></button>
<button class="hb-step" data-step="1" aria-pressed="false"><small>02 / QUALIFY</small><strong>Style + booking intent</strong></button>
<button class="hb-step" data-step="2" aria-pressed="false"><small>03 / RESPOND</small><strong>Calls, chat &amp; follow-up</strong></button>
<button class="hb-step" data-step="3" aria-pressed="false"><small>04 / CONFIRM</small><strong>Real appointments</strong></button>
</div>
<div class="hb-step-detail" aria-live="polite"><h3 id="hb-step-title">Reach the right local customer.</h3><p id="hb-step-description">Match creative and search intent to the salon's location, genuine style portfolio and appointment capacity.</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="hb-section soft"><div class="hb-wrap">
<span class="hb-kicker">CONNECTED SALON GROWTH</span>
<h2>Everything between the ad and the booking.</h2>
<div class="hb-grid">
<article class="hb-tile"><small>01 / DEMAND</small><h3>Google &amp; Meta Ads</h3><p>Local search campaigns and visually compelling ads built around genuine salon services and availability.</p></article>
<article class="hb-tile"><small>02 / CREATIVE</small><h3>Style-led Content</h3><p>Service-specific imagery, short videos and clear promotional messaging using approved examples of actual work.</p></article>
<article class="hb-tile"><small>03 / CONVERSION</small><h3>Booking Funnels</h3><p>Useful inquiry pages, clear preparation requirements and links to the salon's booking process.</p></article>
<article class="hb-tile"><small>04 / CONVERSATION</small><h3>AI Calls &amp; Chatbots</h3><p>Clearly identified assistants that answer routine questions, collect style preferences and arrange human follow-up.</p></article>
<article class="hb-tile"><small>05 / AUTOMATION</small><h3>CRM &amp; Follow-Up</h3><p>Missed-call recovery, SMS/email workflows, contact assignments, reminders and opt-out management.</p></article>
<article class="hb-tile"><small>06 / MEASUREMENT</small><h3>Verified Bookings</h3><p>Separate inquiries, reached customers, booking requests, confirmed appointments and attended visits.</p></article>
</div></div></section>

